    {
      "id": "3sa07mg",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10.3 REST vs GraphQL vs gRPC"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Memorize HTTP status code series: 2xx (Success), 3xx (Redirection), 4xx (Client Error), and 5xx (Server Error).",
        "Understand key differences between REST (JSON/HTTP 1.1), GraphQL (single endpoint query language), and gRPC (HTTP/2 with Protocol Buffers).",
        "Be prepared for questions on OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities, particularly SQL Injection, Broken Access Control, and XSS."
      ],
      "id": "aue76n0"
    },
    {
      "id": "2jgw9w4",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Feature</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>REST</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>GraphQL</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>gRPC</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Protocol</p>",
            "<p>HTTP</p>",
            "<p>HTTP (POST)</p>",
            "<p>HTTP/2</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Data Format</p>",
            "<p>JSON/XML</p>",
            "<p>JSON</p>",
            "<p>Protocol Buffers (binary)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Query Flexibility</p>",
            "<p>Fixed endpoints; fixed response shape</p>",
            "<p>Client specifies exact data needed</p>",
            "<p>Strongly typed; defined in .proto files</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Over/Under-fetching</p>",
            "<p>Common issues</p>",
            "<p>Solves exactly — fetch precisely what needed</p>",
            "<p>Efficient; no over-fetching</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Real-time</p>",
            "<p>Long polling or SSE needed</p>",
            "<p>Subscriptions built-in</p>",
            "<p>Streaming built-in (unary/bidirectional)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Type Safety</p>",
            "<p>Optional (OpenAPI/Swagger)</p>",
            "<p>Strongly typed schema</p>",
            "<p>Strongly typed by design</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Performance</p>",
            "<p>Good</p>",
            "<p>Good for complex queries</p>",
            "<p>Excellent; binary; low latency</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Best For</p>",
            "<p>Simple CRUD APIs; widely understood</p>",
            "<p>Complex data graphs; mobile (Facebook API)</p>",
            "<p>High-performance microservice-to-microservice communication</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Examples</p>",
            "<p>Most banking APIs, Open Banking (OCEN)</p>",
            "<p>GitHub API, Shopify API</p>",
            "<p>Google internal services, Netflix, gRPC-web</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a3i4t01",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10.4 Web Security — OWASP Top 10"
    },
    {
      "id": "iy3tf2v",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>OWASP Rank</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Vulnerability</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Description</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Prevention</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>A01</p>",
            "<p>Broken Access Control</p>",
            "<p>User can access unauthorised resources; privilege escalation</p>",
            "<p>RBAC; deny by default; access control checks at server</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>A02</p>",
            "<p>Cryptographic Failures</p>",
            "<p>Weak/absent encryption; transmitting sensitive data in clear</p>",
            "<p>TLS everywhere; strong algorithms (AES-256, SHA-256)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>A03</p>",
            "<p>Injection</p>",
            "<p>SQL, NoSQL, LDAP, OS injection via untrusted input</p>",
            "<p>Parameterised queries; input validation; ORMs</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>A04</p>",
            "<p>Insecure Design</p>",
            "<p>Design flaws; missing threat modelling</p>",
            "<p>Secure design principles; threat modelling; abuse cases</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>A05</p>",
            "<p>Security Misconfiguration</p>",
            "<p>Default settings; unnecessary features enabled; verbose errors</p>",
            "<p>Harden configurations; disable defaults; use IaC</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>A06</p>",
            "<p>Vulnerable Components</p>",
            "<p>Using outdated libraries with known CVEs</p>",
            "<p>SCA tools; patch management; dependency tracking</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>A07</p>",
            "<p>Authentication Failures</p>",
            "<p>Weak passwords; no MFA; exposed credentials</p>",
            "<p>MFA; strong session management; credential stuffing protection</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>A08</p>",
            "<p>Integrity Failures</p>",
            "<p>Insecure deserialization; software update without integrity check</p>",
            "<p>Digital signatures; SRI (Subresource Integrity); CI/CD security</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>A09</p>",
            "<p>Logging Failures</p>",
            "<p>Insufficient logging; no monitoring; late breach discovery</p>",
            "<p>Comprehensive logging; SIEM; alert on anomalies</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>A10</p>",
            "<p>SSRF (Server-Side Request Forgery)</p>",
            "<p>Server makes requests to unintended locations</p>",
            "<p>Input validation; allowlist for URLs; network segmentation</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
